<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX FIRMS, ENDS AT 1,484.66 POINTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX FIRMS, ENDS AT 1,484.66 POINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index edged up 3.76 points or 0.25 percent to 1,484.66 points on Wednesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
